Description: Audio spectrum visualizer plugin for Deepin 25 dock
 A real-time audio spectrum analyzer plugin for the Deepin Desktop
 Environment dock. Captures system audio via PulseAudio and renders
 6 visual effects: Bars, Wave, Solid, Beam, Hill, Spectrogram.
 .
 Reference: https://github.com/rbn42/panon
